ly in these urban environments particularly on transit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/outfront-media-inc-out-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q1","e":"out","d":"2019-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Ben Swinburne","x":"But in this sort of shift back towards non-mobile or social or streaming to maybe traditional platforms like out-of-home.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/outfront-media-inc-out-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q1","e":"out","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"We're pleased to be raising our guidance especially on the back of our 8% growth last year and this is strong indication that our strategies are driving shareholder value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/outfront-media-inc-out-q1-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q2","e":"out","d":"2019-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"So the fact that maybe we don't have an Uber or Lyft to, if you like, IPO-ing within the quarter, we still feel good, we feel good about over all the strength of our brand for direct-to-consumer advertisers that we -- we are benefiting from increasingly in the Out-of-Home medium.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q2","e":"out","d":"2019-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"…to the mix in that -- we cannot be far more flexible in terms of campaigns we make, I'm sure -- sure the duration, I mentioned DTC was very fast becoming known as, if you like, the must-advertise place for the new DTC brands that are looking to get that branding out to New York consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q2","e":"out","d":"2019-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"that -- we cannot be far more flexible in terms of campaigns we make, I'm sure -- sure the duration, I mentioned DTC was very fast becoming known as, if you like, the must-advertise place for the new DTC brands that are looking to get that branding out to New York consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q2","e":"out","d":"2019-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"It's doing great, it's really -- the yield increase is driven mostly by -- by price increases, which we think is a great fact, you know occupancy isn't changing much.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q2","e":"out","d":"2019-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"And I guess the positive comments we gave with regards to AFFO and increasing our guidance range, obviously gives -- gives you a feeling of inherent -- the inherent confidence that we have as we -- as we look forward for the balance of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q3","e":"out","d":"2019-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"For us, specifically, we're having some great conversations with our larger advertisers, where we believe that we may see some benefit obviously from the streaming malls that are going on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/outfront-media-inc-out-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q3","e":"out","d":"2019-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"We think that could be positive for Out-of-Home because most of those -- most of the streaming services are big friends of Out-of-Home.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/outfront-media-inc-out-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q3","e":"out","d":"2019-11-04","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"I guess, that the first point is, we're actually delighted that these sort of DTC companies are thinking about Out-of-Home in general, and indeed OUTFRONT as being a great way to build brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/outfront-media-inc-out-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q3","e":"out","d":"2019-11-04","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"So actually the growth -- our growth sort of belies if you like the -- some of the interest that we're seeing from the DTC brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/outfront-media-inc-out-q3-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2019 Q4","e":"out","d":"2020-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"But one thing that we have seen is streaming that became important for us at the back end of last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/outfront-media-inc-out-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2020 Q1","e":"out","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"Cost reductions have been focus on rightsizing our business for the current environment, including restrictions on discretionary expenses and workforce reduction, furloughs, a hiring freeze and the temporary step-back in compensation for certain employees and our executive officers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/outfront-media-inc-out-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2020 Q1","e":"out","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"As Jeremy said, we're working hard with our landlords plus some of our larger markets have a variable component in posting, maintenance and other and SG&A. There are both and we've taken some steps on personnel issues with hiring freezes, headcount reduction, activity reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/outfront-media-inc-out-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2020 Q2","e":"out","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"While we couldn't reduce them as much as our revenues, we were able to deliver in excess of $100 million of cost savings we'd forecasted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2020 Q2","e":"out","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"SG&A expenses decreased primarily due to restrictions on discretionary expenses, hiring freeze, workforce reductions, employee furloughs, temporary reductions to certain employee-based salaries and lower professional fees, partially offset by a higher provision for doubtful accounts in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2020 Q2","e":"out","d":"2020-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Alexia Quadrani","x":"I wondered if you can give a little bit of color on a little more color on the improvement you are seeing to sort of raise the guide for Q3 versus what you saw in the Q2. what I guess, what you've learned in July and what you're seeing in terms of commitments?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/outfront-media-inc-out-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"OUT 2021 Q3","e":"out","d":"2021-11-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Jeremy J. Male","x":"It was good to see the Bond movie open in theaters and perform so well after moving the release date a number of times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/outfront-media-inc-out-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q1","e":"out","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"On Slide 12, the company's adjusted OIBDA in the first quarter benefited from lower corporate expense, which declined by about $6 million due primarily to lower compensation-related expenses, including last year's severance, and lower professional fees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/outfront-media-out-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q2","e":"out","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Nicolas Brien","x":"We have supercharged our sales engine by investing in industry leading sales tools such as AI enabled integrated CRM and the marketing cloud, as well as advanced sales training.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/outfront-media-out-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q2","e":"out","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"Corporate was up about $3 million due to higher compensation related expenses including severance and the impact of market fluctuations on an unfunded equity linked retirement plan offered by the company to certain employees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/outfront-media-out-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q3","e":"out","d":"2026-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Nick Brien","x":"From all the conversations we are having, we are having renewal conversations with all those significant advertisers, and as yet, we have only had one direct-to-consumer product offering that has really hit the market, which is Muse by Facebook, by obviously Meta.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/outfront-media-out-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q3","e":"out","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"Lastly, we are also investing in AI enablement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/outfront-media-out-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q3","e":"out","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Nick Brien","x":"As Matt described earlier, that's why we're continuing to invest in the talent, technology, measurement, and AI tools across every function to unlock this growth opportunity and accelerate profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/outfront-media-out-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OUT 2026 Q3","e":"out","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matthew Siegel","x":"Included in this raised guidance is the maintenance CapEx I just mentioned, interest expense of just over $140 million, and a small amount of cash taxes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/outfront-media-out-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,5924,0,0,0,4545,1058],[37,1,6080,0,0,0,4470,1263],[38,1,5790,0,0,0,4526,990],[39,1,5736,0,0,0,4313,1125],[40,1,4613,0,0,0,3852,493],[41,1,6919,0,0,0,5496,1080],[42,1,6614,0,0,0,5340,971],[43,1,4864,0,0,0,3822,769],[44,1,4912,0,0,0,4151,530],[45,1,4425,0,0,0,3435,731],[46,1,3417,0,0,0,2802,370],[47,1,4644,1,1,0,3366,836],[65,1,4321,0,0,0,4083,0],[66,1,5300,0,0,0,1723,3262],[67,1,5204,0,0,0,1458,3453]],"cinema":[[36,1,5924,0,0,0,4545,1058],[37,1,6080,0,0,0,4470,1263],[38,1,5790,0,0,0,4526,990],[39,1,5736,0,0,0,4313,1125],[40,1,4613,0,0,0,3852,493],[41,1,6919,0,0,0,5496,1080],[42,1,6614,0,0,0,5340,971],[43,1,4864,0,0,0,3822,769],[44,1,4912,0,0,0,4151,530],[45,1,4425,0,0,0,3435,731],[46,1,3417,0,0,0,2802,370],[47,1,4644,0,0,0,3366,836],[65,1,4321,0,0,0,4083,0],[66,1,5300,0,0,0,1723,3262],[67,1,5204,0,0,0,1458,3453]],"imax":[[36,1,5924,0,0,0,4545,1058],[37,1,6080,0,0,0,4470,1263],[38,1,5790,0,0,0,4526,990],[39,1,5736,0,0,0,4313,1125],[40,1,4613,0,0,0,3852,493],[41,1,6919,0,0,0,5496,1080],[42,1,6614,0,0,0,5340,971],[43,1,4864,0,0,0,3822,769],[44,1,4912,0,0,0,4151,530],[45,1,4425,0,0,0,3435,731],[46,1,3417,0,0,0,2802,370],[47,1,4644,0,